#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This dialog let you adjust your individual pad borders.<br>\n"
"<br>\n"
"Each pad model differs in size, now we determine the custom values on our "
"own.<br>\n"
"Follow the given instructions and click <b>Next</b> to proceed."
msgstr ""

#. i18n: file adjborderwizardbase.ui line 51
#: rc.cpp:15
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<font color=\"#ff0000\">Notes:</font><br><br>\n"
"1) Position your mouse cursor in the middle of the widget before "
"proceeding.<br>\n"
"2) Edge motion and scrolling emulation will be switched off "
"temporarily.<br>\n"
"3) This won't work for circular pads. In that case press <b>Cancel</b> now."
